  "question": {
    "text": "Match List-I with List-II<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LIST-I<br />\t\t\tCoordination<br />\t\t\tComplex</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LIST-II<br />\t\t\tNumber of unpaired electrons</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Cr</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">II.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">III.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IV.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
